Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, come over here, Sophie.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.24,0:00:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,We'd like to introduce this game's heroine!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.19,0:00:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Sophie. Sophie Belkman.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.72,0:00:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Sophie, why are you so quiet?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.93,0:00:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Sophie is a game character,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.15,0:00:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,so she can't move on unless you press the button.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.95,0:00:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh!?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.40,0:00:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, press the button on the controller!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.85,0:00:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,On this controller? Hyah!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.00,0:00:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother! A missile shot out of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.03,0:00:17.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, this your controller!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.87,0:00:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you even have that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.93,0:00:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Look out, Sophie!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.69,0:00:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Aaaah!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.59,0:00:25.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess game heroines never survive, huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.56,0:00:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Their lives are so sad...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.98,0:00:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna get Velza to curse you.
